secubox-meshtastic (0.1.0-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: multi-grid Meshtastic LoRa node integration (ref #897).
    Config loader, state model, StateCache double-cache, RadioInterface
    (MockRadio + lazy real-serial), grid policy + nft egress allow-list,
    host-side MQTT bridge, passive capture pipeline, daemon engine,
    secubox-meshtasticctl (webui->ctl, sudoers), FastAPI webui backend +
    panel, systemd unit (own socket, never aggregator-served), nginx route,
    menu entry, private "shared_grid" mosquitto broker topology.
  * Debian packaging finalized: install list, postinst (user creation,
    0755-shared-parent / restricted-leaf-dir perms, default config seed,
    enable+start), prerm, README.

